  "description": "UniProt Database workflow skill. Use this skill when the user needs Direct REST API access to UniProt. Protein searches, FASTA retrieval, ID mapping, Swiss-Prot/TrEMBL. For Python workflows with multiple databases, prefer bioservices (unified interface to 40+ services). Use this for direct HTTP/REST work or UniProt-specific control and the operator should rely on the packaged workflow, support pack, troubleshooting notes, and provenance links before merging or handing off.",
